      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 760 300'><rect width='760' height='300' fill='#fff'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='13' font-weight='700' fill='#1e1b4b'>求“x 的某次方的系数／常数项”的四步（示意图，非原卷图）</text><g font-size='11' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'><rect x='18' y='42' width='170' height='40' rx='8' fill='#4f46e5'/><text x='103' y='67'>① 写通项 T(k+1)</text><rect x='200' y='42' width='170' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0369a1'/><text x='285' y='67'>② 整理指数</text><rect x='382' y='42' width='170' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0f766e'/><text x='467' y='67'>③ 令指数 = 目标</text><rect x='564' y='42' width='178' height='40' rx='8' fill='#b45309'/><text x='653' y='67'>④ 代回求系数</text></g><g font-size='11' fill='#111827'><text x='18' y='112' font-weight='700'>三道北京真题按这四步走：</text><text x='18' y='138'>2023：(2x − 1/x)⁵，T = C(5,k)2^(5−k)(−1)^k x^(5−2k)，令 5−2k = 1 → k = 2 → 80</text><text x='18' y='164'>2024：(x − √x)⁴，T = C(4,k)(−1)^k x^(4−k/2)，令 4−k/2 = 3 → k = 2 → 6</text><text x='18' y='190'>2026：(a − √x)⁷，T = C(7,k)(−1)^k a^(7−k) x^(k/2)，令 k/2 = 2 → k = 4 → 35a³ = 280 → a = 2</text><text x='18' y='226' fill='#b45309' font-weight='700'>常数项就是“令指数 = 0”，不要一看到带 1/x 就怕：分母的 x 也是靠指数配平消掉的。</text><text x='18' y='256' font-weight='700'>易错：</text><text x='18' y='278'>项的“系数”要带上 C(n,k) 与负号；“二项式系数”只是 C(n,k)，不含数字因数与负号。</text></g></svg>"
